      <h2 id="creating-rhcos-machines-bare-metal" class="group scroll-mt-20">Creating Red Hat Enterprise Linux CoreOS (RHCOS) machines<a href="#creating-rhcos-machines-bare-metal" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
